nk:20,items:void 0,sportId:25,hasItems:true},{title:"Hurling",url:"/betting-tips/Hurling/26",type:"sport",breadcrumbIdx:"betting-tips-Hurling",rank:20,items:void 0,sportId:26,hasItems:true},{title:"Handball",url:"/betting-tips/Handball/20",type:"sport",breadcrumbIdx:"betting-tips-Handball",rank:49,items:void 0,sportId:20,hasItems:true},{title:"Volleyball",url:"/betting-tips/Volleyball/21",type:"sport",breadcrumbIdx:"betting-tips-Volleyball",rank:50,items:void 0,sportId:21,hasItems:true}],breadcrumbs:[{title:"Football",url:"/betting-tips/Football/1",type:"sport",breadcrumbIdx:"betting-tips-Football",parentSport:1}],availableAds:new Map([["tips-header",void 0],["site-takeover",void 0]]),search:null,bettingTipsParams:{sportId:"1",sportName:"Football",categoryName:null,leagueName:null,eventName:null,limit:20},tiParam:"27da74161f9e2a1bc045c0b89004d41e1792703595955:ouk:google-chrome:unknown:131.0",deviceType:"D",from:null,tkbSettings:{take_over_banners:"3",take_over_banners_position_fixed:"1",start:"2023-09-11 13:38:19",end:"2026-10-31 08:37:03",_cachedAt:"2026-10-22T21:10:05.954Z",_cacheKey:"takeover-banners-settings"},zones:[{slug:"in-events-list",location_id:"L1"}],isHotTips:false,content:{content:{sections:[{title:"About Football Tips at OLBG",sections_content:"\u003Cp>Our Football Tips have been provided by a growing community of knowledgeable sports bettors since 2002. Our particularly strong group of expert football tipsters add their predictions to the site daily.\u003C/p>\u003Ch3>The Best Football Tipsters\u003C/h3>\u003Cp>Our tipsters compete in competitions with huge cash prizes for the best football tipsters. This means that we attract and retain expert and profitable football tipsters.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>For example, at the time of writing (October 2026), this includes tipsters such as:\u003C/p>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/tipsters/about/55960\">hamgrat\u003C/a> with a profit of +795 (to 10pt stakes) over the last 12 months for tips on Correct Scores.\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/tipsters/about/420769\">geobetting\u003C/a> with a profit of +644 (to 10pt stakes) over the last 12 months for tips on the BTTS markets.\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/tipsters/about/380347\">Bowhillbear\u003C/a> has over 35k followers in the \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/app\">OLBG app\u003C/a>.\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003Ch3>The Most Popular Football Tips\u003C/h3>\u003Cp>Above, you can see the most popular football predictions on OLBG today, so this page is perfect if you need some football tips for tonight. If you click on the tips and comments tab in the menu, you will sort the tips by volume, and then you can view the list in order of popularity. Popular tips at OLBG are sometimes called hot football tips.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>In the popular list, you may also see some of tomorrow's football tips or this weekend's football tips. If you are a once-a-week punter, you may just want to look at Saturday football tips. We know that many people come here looking for \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/accumulator-tips\">football accumulator tips\u003C/a>, so you can order the tips by date or by clicking on the events tab. To see the latest football fixture lists, check out the \u003Ca href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/football\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">BBC Football section\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>\u003Ch3>Value Football Tips\u003C/h3>\u003Cp>The Value Rating column above gives you a star indicator out of 5. This is calculated by comparing the % of tips on a selection with the odds of that selection. If the percentage of tips is higher than the chances according to the odds, that is a sign that the selection could be a value bet. Sort this column and look for selections with a high number of stars.\u003C/p>\u003Ch3>Football Tips Most Likely To Win\u003C/h3>\u003Cp>Perhaps the biggest indicator of a tip most likely to win is the odds. Whilst we will always recommend that you search for value football bets, we appreciate that some like to combine short-odds bets. If you want to see the shortest or longest odds tips, then filter the column-marked odds.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>There are many ways to use the OLBG football predictions, so read on for more help. To see today's best predictions from all the sports covered at OLBG, head to the main page for \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips\">betting tips\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>"},{title:"Coverage of Football Tips at OLBG",sections_content:"\u003Cp>OLBG provides football tips from over 100 leagues across many countries around the world. To help you navigate around the site and find the tips from the leagues you want, we split these into the following sections:\u003C/p>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>UK Football Tips – for example, \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/UK/England_Premier_League/1\">Premier League Tips\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>UEFA Club Competition Tips – for example, \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/UEFA_Competitions/Champions_League/1\">Champions League Tips\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>European Football Tips – for example, \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Germany_Bundesliga_I/1\">Bundesliga Tips\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>World Club Football Tips – for example, \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Brazil_Serie_A/1\">Brazil Serie A Tips\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>International Competition Football Tips – for example, \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/International/Euro_2028/1\">Euro 2028 Tips\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003Cp>During the off-season, it is also worth keeping an eye out for \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/Friendlies/Club_Friendlies/1\">Club Friendlies\u003C/a> tips as teams prepare for the new season, which is also the case for \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/Friendlies/1\">International Friendlies\u003C/a> in between the major competitions.\u003C/p>"},{title:"Football Accumulator Tips and Bet Builder",sections_content:"\u003Cp>Accumulators are one of the most popular ways to bet on football, combining several selections into a single bet for a bigger potential return. Our daily \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/accumulator-tips\">football accumulator tips\u003C/a> are generated automatically from the strongest consensus among our best-performing tipsters — the system looks for profitable, consistent tipsters and spots when they agree, then builds the acca from those selections. This includes a Football 4-Fold each evening and at weekends, plus a UK Football 4-Fold every Saturday. If you'd rather build your own, the Create My Acca tool lets you combine selections into a football accumulator in a few clicks.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>For single-match multiples, our \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/bet-builder\">Bet Builder\u003C/a> page lets you build and edit bets across markets within the same game, guided by the OLBG tipsters' predictions. You can see which outcomes have attracted the most tips before you decide what to include, then take your finished Bet Builder to bet365.\u003C/p>"},{title:"Top European Leagues Compared",sections_content:"\u003Cp>Plenty of bettors will only be interested in the top European leagues, so here we have a table highlighting the statistics for the top five leagues in Europe. Over the last five completed seasons, we look at the percentage of favourites who win, the percentage of underdogs, the average number of goals per game and then the success rate for both BTTS and Over 2.5 goals, so you can easily compare the leagues.\u003C/p>\u003Ctable class=\"branded\" style=\"width:100%;\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"col\">League\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align:center;\" title=\"Percentage of games won by the favourites\">Favs\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align:center;\" title=\"Percentage of games won by the underdogs\">Dogs\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align:center;\" title=\"Average number of goals per game\">AGPG\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align:center;\" title=\"Percentage of games with both teams scoring\">BTTS\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align:center;\" title=\"Percentage of games finishing with 3+ goals\">Overs\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align:center;\" title=\"Number of matches in the sample\">Matches\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/UK/England_Premier_League/1\">England Premier League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">55.74%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">20.26%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">2.93\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">55.32%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">56.58%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">1,900\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Spain_Primera_Liga/1\">Spanish La Liga\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">54.32%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">19.42%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">2.59\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">51.84%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">47.37%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">1,900\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Germany_Bundesliga_I/1\">Germany Bundesliga I\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">53.76%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">21.12%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">3.18\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">60.10%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">61.02%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">1,529\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Italy_Serie_A/1\">Italy Serie A\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">53.53%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">19.05%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">2.61\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">51.37%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">48.89%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">1,900\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/France_Ligue_1/1\">France Ligue 1\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">52.56%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">22.77%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">2.82\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">55.13%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">53.52%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd style=\"text-align:center;\">1,678\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>"},{title:"Full-Time Result Statistics: Best Football Leagues by Result Type",sections_content:"\u003Ch3>Best Leagues for Winning Favourites\u003C/h3>\u003Cp>How often the bookies get it right is the next thing to look at. By this, we mean which league tops the list when it comes to winning favourites and which is the most reliable for backing favourites. Over the last five completed seasons, with a total of \u003Cstrong>63.84%\u003C/strong> winning favourites, the league coming out on top is the \u003Cstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Singapore_Premier_League/1\">Singapore Premier League\u003C/a>\u003C/strong>. If focusing on just favourites when playing at home, then it is also the \u003Cstrong>Singapore Premier League\u003C/strong> which still comes out on top with \u003Cstrong>63.86%\u003C/strong> of those favourites winning.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Here are the top five leagues for best-performing favourites:\u003C/p>\u003Ctable class=\"branded\" style=\"width:100%;\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:10%;\">Rank\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:45%;\">League\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:25%;\">Favourites Winning\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:20%;\">Matches\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>1\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Singapore_Premier_League/1\">Singapore Premier League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>63.84%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>531\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>2\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Northern_Ireland_Premier/1\">Northern Ireland Premier\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>58.82%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,139\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>3\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/China_CSL/1\">China CSL\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>57.42%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,193\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>4\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Portugal_Primeira_Liga/1\">Portugal Primeira Liga\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>57.32%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,530\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>5\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Bulgaria_First_League/1\">Bulgaria First League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>56.42%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,356\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003Ch3>Best Leagues for Backing Underdogs\u003C/h3>\u003Cp>All punters love an underdog; that is because of the bigger odds, and if you can get them right, then you get a better return for your money, but they are underdogs for a reason with the bookies, so caution has to be taken when backing these. Regarding which league has the best record for underdogs winning that we cover on OLBG, that would be \u003Cstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/UK/England_National_League_South/1\">England National League South\u003C/a>\u003C/strong>, which has seen \u003Cstrong>28.03%\u003C/strong> of underdogs going on to beat the favourites.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Here are the top five leagues for underdog winners:\u003C/p>\u003Ctable class=\"branded\" style=\"width:100%;\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:10%;\">Rank\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:45%;\">League\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:25%;\">Underdogs Winning\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:20%;\">Matches\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>1\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/UK/England_National_League_South/1\">England National League South\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>28.03%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2,626\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>2\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Japan_J1_League/1\">Japan J1 League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>27.96%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,552\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>3\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Australia_A_League/1\">Australia A-League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>27.73%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>797\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>4\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/South_Korea_K_League_1/1\">South Korean K League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>27.23%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,109\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>5\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/UK/Scotland_League_Two/1\">Scotland League Two\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>26.89%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>900\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003Ch3>Best Leagues for Home Wins, Away Wins and Draws\u003C/h3>\u003Cp>Home advantage can be one of the biggest factors in football; the familiarity with the facilities, the support of the majority of the fans and things like knowing how the pitch will play can all be big advantages. The league which tops the list when it comes to success at home is the \u003Cstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Brazil_Serie_A/1\">Brazil Serie A\u003C/a>\u003C/strong>, which over the past five completed seasons has seen \u003Cstrong>46.89%\u003C/strong> of the home teams going on to win their matches.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Travelling is a much more difficult side of the game; teams can travel up and down countries, having to stay overnight in hotels, which can affect routines, and then they have to play in front of opposing fans, meaning picking up wins on the road is much rarer. Having said that, the top league for away wins is the \u003Cstrong>Singapore Premier League\u003C/strong>, which has seen \u003Cstrong>40.30%\u003C/strong> of the visiting teams come away with a win.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Plenty of punters like to play draws; for matches they see as close, then maybe the draw is the best option, as it usually offers plenty of value too, which is why it is so popular. Looking over the leagues, with a strike rate of \u003Cstrong>31.96%\u003C/strong> for draws, it's the \u003Cstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Italy_Serie_B/1\">Italian Serie B\u003C/a>\u003C/strong> which tops the list for the largest percentage of games finishing in draws.\u003C/p>\u003Ctable class=\"branded\" style=\"width:100%;\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:25%;\">Result Type\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:50%;\">Top League\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:25%;\">Strike Rate\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Home win\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Brazil_Serie_A/1\">Brazil Serie A\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>46.89%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Away win\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Singapore_Premier_League/1\">Singapore Premier League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>40.30%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>Draw\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Italy_Serie_B/1\">Italy Serie B\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>31.96%\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>"},{title:"Goal Statistics: Best Football Leagues for Goals, BTTS and Over 2.5",sections_content:"\u003Ch3>Which Leagues Produce the Most Goals Per Game?\u003C/h3>\u003Cp>When you combine all of the leagues and look at the average number of goals per game over the last five completed seasons, that number stands at \u003Cstrong>2.70\u003C/strong> goals per game on average. The top league for goals is the \u003Cstrong>Singapore Premier League\u003C/strong>, which has, on average, produced \u003Cstrong>4.15\u003C/strong> goals per game, which is +1.45 more than the average. At the other end of the spectrum, the least-producing league in terms of match goals is the \u003Cstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/South_Africa_Premier/1\">South African Premier League\u003C/a>\u003C/strong>, which has an average of \u003Cstrong>2.03\u003C/strong> goals per game, which is 0.67 fewer than the average.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Here are the top five goal-producing leagues:\u003C/p>\u003Ctable class=\"branded\" style=\"width:100%;\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:10%;\">Rank\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:45%;\">League\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:25%;\">Average Goals Per Game\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:20%;\">Matches\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>1\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Singapore_Premier_League/1\">Singapore Premier League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>4.15\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>531\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>2\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Germany_Bundesliga_I/1\">Germany Bundesliga I\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>3.18\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,529\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>3\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Australia_A_League/1\">Australia A-League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>3.10\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>797\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>4\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Norway_Eliteserien/1\">Norway Eliteserien\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>3.09\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,199\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>5\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Netherlands_Eerste_Divisie/1\">Netherlands Eerste Divisie\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>3.08\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,826\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003Ch3>Which Leagues Are Best for BTTS Bets?\u003C/h3>\u003Cp>If you are a fan of a BTTS bet, then this section is for you. For those not familiar with the bet, it stands for 'Both Teams to Score', which is pretty self-explanatory; it means that you are backing that both teams will score at least one goal in the game. With a \u003Cstrong>67.23%\u003C/strong> strike rate for successful BTTS matches, the \u003Cstrong>Singapore Premier League\u003C/strong> comes out on top as the best league. At the other end, the \u003Cstrong>South African Premier League\u003C/strong> has seen just \u003Cstrong>40.63%\u003C/strong> of matches finishing with goals for both, so it would be better to prefer the 'No' option of the bet.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Best leagues for the BTTS bet:\u003C/p>\u003Ctable class=\"branded\" style=\"width:100%;\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:10%;\">Rank\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:45%;\">League\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:25%;\">BTTS Strike Rate\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:20%;\">Matches\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>1\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Singapore_Premier_League/1\">Singapore Premier League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>67.23%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>531\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>2\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Switzerland_Super_League/1\">Switzerland Super League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>62.70%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,043\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>3\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Australia_A_League/1\">Australia A-League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>60.98%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>797\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>4\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Germany_Bundesliga_I/1\">Germany Bundesliga I\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>60.10%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,529\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>5\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/USA_MLS/1\">USA MLS\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>59.61%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>2,431\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\u003Ch3>Best Leagues for Over 2.5 Goals\u003C/h3>\u003Cp>If BTTS isn't for you and you like the Over 2.5 Goals bet better, which means you don't need both teams to score, one team could score 3+ goals and your bet would be good. The \u003Cstrong>Singapore Premier League\u003C/strong> is the most productive for games finishing with three or more goals; the league has seen \u003Cstrong>77.21%\u003C/strong> of the games do just that. One league that may be worth avoiding when it comes to the Over 2.5 Goals bet is the \u003Cstrong>South African Premier League\u003C/strong>, as just \u003Cstrong>32.82%\u003C/strong> of games would have been successful with three or more goals.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Best leagues for the Over 2.5 Goals bet:\u003C/p>\u003Ctable class=\"branded\" style=\"width:100%;\">\u003Cthead>\u003Ctr>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:10%;\">Rank\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:45%;\">League\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:25%;\">Over 2.5 Goals Strike Rate\u003C/th>\u003Cth scope=\"col\" style=\"width:20%;\">Matches\u003C/th>\u003C/tr>\u003C/thead>\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>1\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Singapore_Premier_League/1\">Singapore Premier League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>77.21%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>531\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>2\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Germany_Bundesliga_I/1\">Germany Bundesliga I\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>61.02%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,529\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>3\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Norway_Eliteserien/1\">Norway Eliteserien\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>60.80%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,199\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>4\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/European_Competitions/Netherlands_Eerste_Divisie/1\">Netherlands Eerste Divisie\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>60.62%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>1,826\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd>5\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/World_Competitions/Australia_A_League/1\">Australia A-League\u003C/a>\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>60.48%\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>797\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>"},{title:"How Can I See More Detail on Today's Football Tips?",sections_content:"\u003Col>\u003Cli>Click on a match above.\u003C/li>\u003Cli>This will then take you to a page showing all of the predictions on that specific football match.\u003C/li>\u003Cli>You will see a breakdown of the most popular tips in the outright market and the tip from the best tipster tipping on this match.\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Scroll down to see tips from all the other markets, read comments from tipsters and analyse their records.\u003C/li>\u003Cli>We show one tip comment for each selection, but you can click \"View all tips\" to see more.\u003C/li>\u003C/ol>\u003Ch4>The Most Popular Football Tips at OLBG Are:\u003C/h4>\u003Cp>Once you're on a match page, you'll find tips across a wide range of markets. The most popular football tip types at OLBG are:\u003C/p>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>1x2 Tips (also known as win-draw-win tips or outright tips)\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Total Goals Tips (under/over 2.5 goal tips are the most popular)\u003C/li>\u003Cli>BTTS (both teams to score) Tips\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Result and BTTS Tips\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Half-Time/Full-Time Tips\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Asian Handicap Tips\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Anytime Goalscorer Tips\u003C/li>\u003Cli>First Goalscorer Tips\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Correct Score Tips\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Player to Be Booked Tips\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Total Corners Tips\u003C/li>\u003Cli>Total Cards Tips\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003Cp>For each market and prediction, you will be able to see the number of winning tips, % confidence, star rating and odds.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Also, you will be able to see the tip comments below from our top football tipsters.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Look at the tipster's level stakes profit over the last 6 months, their strike rate and other stats we highlight, such as this month's strike rate or winning days in a row, to help you to judge whether you want to follow the selection or not.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Please remember that OLBG tips are there as information to help with your own decision, not to make it for you. Every prediction reflects one tipster's opinion, and even the strongest tipster records include losing runs; there is never a guaranteed winning tip, so it's worth doing your own research rather than following any selection blindly. This is especially true in football, as many factors can change between when a tipster posts and kick-off. Team news is a prime example — a key player may be missing that the tipster was unaware of. Only ever bet what you can comfortably afford to lose and set yourself limits before you start. If gambling ever stops feeling fun, support is available through \u003Ca href=\"https://www.gambleaware.org\">GambleAware\u003C/a> and \u003Ca href=\"https://www.gamcare.org.uk\">GamCare\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>"},{title:"How Else Can I Access OLBG's Football Tips?",sections_content:"\u003Cp>As well as visiting our football tips pages on the web, whether on your desktop or mobile, you can get access to all our predictions via the \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/app\">OLBG tips app\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Using the app, which has been installed by over 1 million people, is a really easy way to look through all the football tips.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>You can start with the hot tips section to see the most popular tips of the day, then filter to football tips to just see the most popular football tips today and use the confidence filters and minimum/maximum odds to tailor the tips for you.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Over on our X channel (formerly Twitter), we love to chat about today's football tips as well as all other sports. Our social media team pick out tips from the OLBG members, highlighting great value tips, thoughtful reasoning and members in profit or on a good winning run. You can follow \u003Ca href=\"https://x.com/OLBG\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">OLBG\u003C/a> on X for more football tips.\u003C/p>"},{title:"Do you have football specialists by league at OLBG?",sections_content:"\u003Cp>We have a large number of excellent football tipsters at OLBG. Some specialise in \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/UK/England_Premier_League/1\">Premier League football tips\u003C/a>, while others go further down the leagues to offer top UK football tips. Some of our tipsters can be seen at their best when tipping on&nbsp;\u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/UEFA_Competitions/Champions_League/1\">Champions League football tips\u003C/a>, while others focus on other European and worldwide football leagues.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>We cover a huge range of leagues for our predictions at OLBG, far bigger than most other football tips sites. Some of our football tipsters specialise in specific markets such as under or over goals, both teams to score and Asian handicaps.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Some of our tipsters strive for consistency and show profit month after month, while others look for bigger value bets at higher odds. If you are looking for football tipsters who are both profitable and consistent, then you can view them on our \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/best-tipsters/Football/1\">best football tipsters\u003C/a> page, where you can analyse the tipsters from almost any angle you want.\u003C/p>"},{title:"Where Are the Best Places to Bet on Football?",sections_content:"\u003Cp>Outside of OLBG, we recommend top sources of quality information to help you with your football betting.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>To get the most out of your football betting, you need the \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/bookmakers.php\">best betting sites\u003C/a> to bet at, so we have written a detailed guide to help you identify the \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/bookmakers/articles/best-bookmakers-for-football-betting\">best football bookmakers\u003C/a> to bet with.\u003C/p>\u003Cp>There are some great betting offers available around football, including enhanced odds, so before opening a new bookmaker account online, also take a look through our comprehensive list of \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/free.php\">free bets\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>"},{title:"Who Created This Content",sections_content:"\u003Cp>Our Football Tips and the content on this page are carefully managed by a formidable team led by Darren Brett, an industry titan with over 30 years in sports betting and tipster competitions. Alongside Darren, Andy Powell, a veteran in betting strategy with 17 years of experience, and James Banting, a sports betting specialist, contribute their in-depth knowledge to offer valuable insights. With expertise in everything from football betting odds to technical bet settling, our experts bring a wealth of information to the field. Their collective goal is to empower the vibrant OLBG Tipster community, whose diverse perspectives and advice make our Football Tips among the most popular anywhere, with over 1 million downloads of the OLBG Tipping app to date.\u003C/p>\u003Cdiv class=\"author-box-component mb-8 p-6 bg-olbg-light-blue rounded-md items-center md:items-start justify-center md:justify-start flex flex-col md:flex-row color-bleu  compact\">\u003Ca class=\"rounded-full flex justify-center items-center overflow-hidden w-24 h-24 mb-6 md:mr-6 border-[6px] border-gray-500 border-opacity-25 image-outside\" href=\"/meet-the-experts/darren-brett\">\u003Cpicture>\u003Csource srcset=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/649/ec7/564/649ec7564fbfa346637961.jpeg&amp;w=80&amp;h=80&amp;zc=1\" media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\"> \u003Csource srcset=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/649/ec7/564/649ec7564fbfa346637961.jpeg&amp;w=100&amp;h=100&amp;zc=1\" media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\"> \u003Cimg alt=\"Darren Brett\" src=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/649/ec7/564/649ec7564fbfa346637961.jpeg&amp;w=80&amp;h=80&amp;zc=1\" title=\"Darren Brett\" class=\"w-full h-auto\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/picture>\u003C/a> \u003Cdiv class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 items-center text-center md:items-start md:text-left\">\u003Cp class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Tipster Competition Manager\u003C/p>  \u003Cdiv class=\"mb-2\">Darren has looked after and built the OLBG Tipster competition into what it is today, with a meticulous eye for what the community needs to thrive. A fan of QPR, he doesn't attend as often as he wants, as he is often making sure the football tips on OLBG are working perfectly.\u003C/div> \u003Cp class=\"mb-0 author-box-info\">- \u003Ca class=\"font-bold underline text-olbg-blue-gray hover:text-olbg-orange\" href=\"/meet-the-experts/darren-brett\">Darren Brett\u003C/a>, Content Editor\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"author-box-component mb-8 p-6 bg-olbg-light-blue rounded-md items-center md:items-start justify-center md:justify-start flex flex-col md:flex-row color-bleu  compact\">\u003Ca class=\"rounded-full flex justify-center items-center overflow-hidden w-24 h-24 mb-6 md:mr-6 border-[6px] border-gray-500 border-opacity-25 image-outside\" href=\"/meet-the-experts/james-banting\">\u003Cpicture>\u003Csource srcset=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/646/cad/0b9/646cad0b934d0036752766.jpg&amp;w=80&amp;h=80&amp;zc=1\" media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\"> \u003Csource srcset=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/646/cad/0b9/646cad0b934d0036752766.jpg&amp;w=100&amp;h=100&amp;zc=1\" media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\"> \u003Cimg alt=\"James Banting\" src=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/646/cad/0b9/646cad0b934d0036752766.jpg&amp;w=80&amp;h=80&amp;zc=1\" title=\"James Banting\" class=\"w-full h-auto\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/picture>\u003C/a> \u003Cdiv class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 items-center text-center md:items-start md:text-left\">\u003Cp class=\"text-xl font-bold\">An Eye for Detail\u003C/p>  \u003Cdiv class=\"mb-2\">James is part of the team that checks every single tip comment offered on OLBG by our members to ensure they are worthy of being shown to the public, no mean feat. Especially given the weekend commitment and the clash with his beloved Portsmouth playing. His favourite bet on football is an acca on the Over 2.5 goals market.\u003C/div> \u003Cp class=\"mb-0 author-box-info\">- \u003Ca class=\"font-bold underline text-olbg-blue-gray hover:text-olbg-orange\" href=\"/meet-the-experts/james-banting\">James Banting\u003C/a>, Content Editor\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"author-box-component mb-8 p-6 bg-[#414a5e] text-white rounded-md items-center md:items-start justify-center md:justify-start flex flex-col md:flex-row color-dark  compact\">\u003Ca class=\"rounded-full flex justify-center items-center overflow-hidden w-24 h-24 mb-6 md:mr-6 border-[6px] border-gray-500 border-opacity-25 image-outside\" href=\"/meet-the-experts/andy-powell\">\u003Cpicture>\u003Csource srcset=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/646/cb8/b22/646cb8b22351f225446960.jpg&amp;w=80&amp;h=80&amp;zc=1\" media=\"(max-width: 1023px)\"> \u003Csource srcset=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/646/cb8/b22/646cb8b22351f225446960.jpg&amp;w=100&amp;h=100&amp;zc=1\" media=\"(min-width: 1024px)\"> \u003Cimg alt=\"Andy Powell\" src=\"https://olbgimages.co.uk/image-cache?src=https://olbgimages.co.uk/storage/gallery/october-app/uploads/public/646/cb8/b22/646cb8b22351f225446960.jpg&amp;w=80&amp;h=80&amp;zc=1\" title=\"Andy Powell\" class=\"w-full h-auto\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/picture>\u003C/a> \u003Cdiv class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 items-center text-center md:items-start md:text-left\">\u003Cp class=\"text-xl font-bold\">Stats, Stats and More Stats\u003C/p>  \u003Cdiv class=\"mb-2\">Andy is all about the numbers, ensuring our football tipster records are all in perfect order for users to explore. A keen follower of his beloved Ipswich Town, you'll often find Andy celebrating a BTTS acca at the weekend.\u003C/div> \u003Cp class=\"mb-0 author-box-info\">- \u003Ca class=\"font-bold underline text-olbg-blue-gray hover:text-olbg-orange\" href=\"/meet-the-experts/andy-powell\">Andy Powell\u003C/a>, Content Editor\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Chr>\u003Cp class=\"text-muted\">\u003Csmall>These statistics are compiled by OLBG from full-time results across all football leagues available in the OLBG tipster competition. They include all games which were not two-legged or knockout over the last five completed seasons of each league (currently up to and including 2025-26).\u003C/small>\u003C/p>"},{title:"Football Tips FAQ",sections_content:"\u003Cdiv>\u003Cheader class=\"sct-hdr  \">\u003Ch3 class=\"text-2xl\">\u003Ci class=\"text-2xl i-ui-faq text-olbg-orange\">\u003C/i> FAQ\u003C/h3> \u003Cp class=\"mb-2 text-gray-400 tagline\">Football Tips FAQs\u003C/p>\u003C/header> \u003Cdiv class=\"faq\">\u003Cdiv class=\"flex flex-col gap-0 sm:gap-3 sm:flex-row fq-cnt\">\u003Cul class=\"flex-1 [&amp;&amp;]:p-0 [&amp;&amp;]:m-0 h-rst-ls\">\u003Cli data-faq-card=\"\" class=\"group p-2 px-3 [&amp;&amp;]:mb-3 hover:bg-[#fff6e8] hover:cursor-pointer list-none bg-white border rounded border-c-border-2 shadow-sm faq-crd\" data-num=\"1\">\u003Ch4 class=\"p-0 m-0\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" data-faq-toggle=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center w-full p-0 m-0 text text-left bg-transparent border-0 qa-title\">\u003Cspan class=\"flex-1 max-md:!text-md max-md:leading-relaxed max-md:pr-10 md:!text-base\">Who is the best football tipster?\u003C/span> \u003Ci class=\"i-ui-dropdown-arrow text-olbg-orange group-[.card-opened]:-rotate-90 text-xs\">\u003C/i>\u003C/button>\u003C/h4> \u003Cdiv class=\"hidden group-[.card-opened]:block pb-0 mt-2 mb-0 answer\">\u003Cp>The best football tipster is all about preference. If you are talking about the best English Premier League tipster, then for the 2025-26 season, that was \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/tipsters/tips/531368\">Isibiki\u003C/a>, who returned a profit of +516 (to 10pt stakes) in the 1X2 market. Perhaps you want a Correct Scores tipster? Ahead of the new season (2026-27), for the 12 months prior, \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/tipsters/tips/642100\">Abhinav9\u003C/a> returned a profit of +720. You can compare football tipsters by market, strike rate and profit on our \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/best-tipsters/Football/1\">best football tipsters page\u003C/a>.\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/li>\u003Cli data-faq-card=\"\" class=\"group p-2 px-3 [&amp;&amp;]:mb-3 hover:bg-[#fff6e8] hover:cursor-pointer list-none bg-white border rounded border-c-border-2 shadow-sm faq-crd\" data-num=\"2\">\u003Ch4 class=\"p-0 m-0\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" data-faq-toggle=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center w-full p-0 m-0 text text-left bg-transparent border-0 qa-title\">\u003Cspan class=\"flex-1 max-md:!text-md max-md:leading-relaxed max-md:pr-10 md:!text-base\">Should you pay for football tips?\u003C/span> \u003Ci class=\"i-ui-dropdown-arrow text-olbg-orange group-[.card-opened]:-rotate-90 text-xs\">\u003C/i>\u003C/button>\u003C/h4> \u003Cdiv class=\"hidden group-[.card-opened]:block pb-0 mt-2 mb-0 answer\">\u003Cp>No, you should never pay for football tips, because you can access so many excellent tips here at OLBG for free.\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/li>\u003Cli data-faq-card=\"\" class=\"group p-2 px-3 [&amp;&amp;]:mb-3 hover:bg-[#fff6e8] hover:cursor-pointer list-none bg-white border rounded border-c-border-2 shadow-sm faq-crd\" data-num=\"3\">\u003Ch4 class=\"p-0 m-0\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" data-faq-toggle=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center w-full p-0 m-0 text text-left bg-transparent border-0 qa-title\">\u003Cspan class=\"flex-1 max-md:!text-md max-md:leading-relaxed max-md:pr-10 md:!text-base\">Can you make money from betting on football?\u003C/span> \u003Ci class=\"i-ui-dropdown-arrow text-olbg-orange group-[.card-opened]:-rotate-90 text-xs\">\u003C/i>\u003C/button>\u003C/h4> \u003Cdiv class=\"hidden group-[.card-opened]:block pb-0 mt-2 mb-0 answer\">\u003Cp>You can make money betting on football, but professional football bettors are less common than professional horse racing bettors. To win consistently, you need to find value bets regularly, which means finding an edge over the market. This is far harder for football, as much of the form and the reasons for finding a good bet are exposed, and the betting margins are tighter.\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003Cul class=\"flex-1 [&amp;&amp;]:p-0 [&amp;&amp;]:m-0 h-rst-ls\">\u003Cli data-faq-card=\"\" class=\"group p-2 px-3 [&amp;&amp;]:mb-3 hover:bg-[#fff6e8] hover:cursor-pointer list-none bg-white border rounded border-c-border-2 shadow-sm faq-crd\" data-num=\"1\">\u003Ch4 class=\"p-0 m-0\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" data-faq-toggle=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center w-full p-0 m-0 text text-left bg-transparent border-0 qa-title\">\u003Cspan class=\"flex-1 max-md:!text-md max-md:leading-relaxed max-md:pr-10 md:!text-base\">How do you pick a winning football bet?\u003C/span> \u003Ci class=\"i-ui-dropdown-arrow text-olbg-orange group-[.card-opened]:-rotate-90 text-xs\">\u003C/i>\u003C/button>\u003C/h4> \u003Cdiv class=\"hidden group-[.card-opened]:block pb-0 mt-2 mb-0 answer\">\u003Cp>You pick a winning football bet after skilful analysis of the form. There are many angles to study, such as team form and head-to-head records, but also team formations, player fitness and how different selections will impact the game. Visit our \u003Ca href=\"https://www.olbg.com/bookmakers/articles/category/learning\">Bookie Guides: Learning\u003C/a> section to understand some of the angles that OLBG members use to find a winning football bet.\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/li>\u003Cli data-faq-card=\"\" class=\"group p-2 px-3 [&amp;&amp;]:mb-3 hover:bg-[#fff6e8] hover:cursor-pointer list-none bg-white border rounded border-c-border-2 shadow-sm faq-crd\" data-num=\"2\">\u003Ch4 class=\"p-0 m-0\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" data-faq-toggle=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center w-full p-0 m-0 text text-left bg-transparent border-0 qa-title\">\u003Cspan class=\"flex-1 max-md:!text-md max-md:leading-relaxed max-md:pr-10 md:!text-base\">What is the best football prediction site?\u003C/span> \u003Ci class=\"i-ui-dropdown-arrow text-olbg-orange group-[.card-opened]:-rotate-90 text-xs\">\u003C/i>\u003C/button>\u003C/h4> \u003Cdiv class=\"hidden group-[.card-opened]:block pb-0 mt-2 mb-0 answer\">\u003Cp>We'd argue OLBG is the best football prediction site, because here you can benefit from the knowledge of hundreds of expert football tipsters who specialise in different leagues and markets and have different strategies for finding winners. You can find great tipsters to follow but, more importantly, you can learn by understanding their betting tactics. The proof is in the records — every tipster's profit, strike rate and consistency is there for you to analyse, so you can judge the quality for yourself rather than taking our word for it.\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/li>\u003Cli data-faq-card=\"\" class=\"group p-2 px-3 [&amp;&amp;]:mb-3 hover:bg-[#fff6e8] hover:cursor-pointer list-none bg-white border rounded border-c-border-2 shadow-sm faq-crd\" data-num=\"3\">\u003Ch4 class=\"p-0 m-0\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" data-faq-toggle=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center w-full p-0 m-0 text text-left bg-transparent border-0 qa-title\">\u003Cspan class=\"flex-1 max-md:!text-md max-md:leading-relaxed max-md:pr-10 md:!text-base\">How do I win a football bet every time?\u003C/span> \u003Ci class=\"i-ui-dropdown-arrow text-olbg-orange group-[.card-opened]:-rotate-90 text-xs\">\u003C/i>\u003C/button>\u003C/h4> \u003Cdiv class=\"hidden group-[.card-opened]:block pb-0 mt-2 mb-0 answer\">\u003Cp>You will not win a bet every time, and there are no sure-fire, guaranteed-win bets. The way to profit from betting is to bet at value odds as consistently as possible — betting at odds greater than a selection's true chance of winning — and by doing that, you will turn the odds in your favour.\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div> \u003Cdiv>\u003Cscript type=\"application/ld+json\">\n        {\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"name\": \"Football Tips FAQs\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Who is the best football tipster?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The best football tipster is all about preference. If you are talking about the best English Premier League tipster, then for the 2025-26 season, that was Isibiki, who returned a profit of +516 (to 10pt stakes) in the 1X2 market. Perhaps you want a Correct Scores tipster? Ahead of the new season (2026-27), for the 12 months prior, Abhinav9 returned a profit of +720. You can compare football tipsters by market, strike rate and profit on our best football tipsters page.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Should you pay for football tips?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"No, you should never pay for football tips, because you can access so many excellent tips here at OLBG for free.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can you make money from betting on football?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"You can make money betting on football, but professional football bettors are less common than professional horse racing bettors. To win consistently, you need to find value bets regularly, which means finding an edge over the market. This is far harder for football, as much of the form and the reasons for finding a good bet are exposed, and the betting margins are tighter.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do you pick a winning football bet?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"You pick a winning football bet after skilful analysis of the form. There are many angles to study, such as team form and head-to-head records, but also team formations, player fitness and how different selections will impact the game. Visit our Bookie Guides: Learning section to understand some of the angles that OLBG members use to find a winning football bet.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the best football prediction site?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We'd argue OLBG is the best football prediction site, because here you can benefit from the knowledge of hundreds of expert football tipsters who specialise in different leagues and markets and have different strategies for finding winners. You can find great tipsters to follow but, more importantly, you can learn by understanding their betting tactics. The proof is in the records — every tipster's profit, strike rate and consistency is there for you to analyse, so you can judge the quality for yourself rather than taking our word for it.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do I win a football bet every time?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"You will not win a bet every time, and there are no sure-fire, guaranteed-win bets. The way to profit from betting is to bet at value odds as consistently as possible — betting at odds greater than a selection's true chance of winning — and by doing that, you will turn the odds in your favour.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n    \u003C/script>\u003C/div> \n        \u003Cscript>\n            // Wire FAQ card open/close for non-hydrating render() output.\n            (function initFaqCardToggles() {\n                function bind() {\n                    document.querySelectorAll('[data-faq-toggle]').forEach(function (el) {\n                        if (el.getAttribute('data-faq-bound') === '1') return;\n                        el.setAttribute('data-faq-bound', '1');\n                        el.addEventListener('click', function () {\n                            var card = el.closest('[data-faq-card]');\n                            if (!card) return;\n                            var opened = card.classList.toggle('card-opened');\n                            el.setAttribute('aria-expanded', opened ? 'true' : 'false');\n                        });\n                    });\n                }\n                if (document.readyState === 'loading') {\n                    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', bind);\n                } else {\n                    bind();\n                }\n            })();\n        \u003C/script>\n     \u003Cstyle>\n        .dark.is-faq .sct-hdr h3 {\n            color: #fdfdfd;\n        }\n    \u003C/style>"}]}},mainContentClasses:void 0,pageSchema:"\u003Cscript type='application/ld+json'>{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n      \"@id\": \"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/1\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.olbg.com/betting-tips/Football/1\",\n      \"name\": \"Football Betting Tips (FREE): Today & This Weekend\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"@type\": \"OnlineBusiness\",\n        \"name\": \"OLBG\",\n        \"alternateName\": \"Online Betting Guide\",\n        \"legalName\": \"Invendium Ltd\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.olbg.com/\",\n        \"@id\": \"https://www.olbg.com/#online-business\",\n        \"sameAs\": [\n          \"https://twitter.com/OLBG\",\n        